==Requirements==
Player must own a usable glide-trainable [[ride]] along with waiting at least one day after completion of [[Quest:Glide Training: Getting Started]] in order to do [[Quest:Glide Training: Basic Training]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Troy Ridewrangler]] located near the [[Seaside]] [[Warpstones|Warpstone]].
==Goals==
Bounce through the fiery hoop above the launch pad in Merry Vale while on your untrained glide-trainable ride.
*Bounce through the Merry Vale hoop
*Return to Troy Ridewrangler
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Troy Ridewrangler]] located near the [[Seaside]] [[Warpstones|Warpstone]].
#*"The second step in training a ride is to make sure that the ride understands the absolute basics of gliding.<br />Go to the launch pads in Merry Vale and jump through the fiery hoop above while riding your untrained glide-trainable ride." -Troy Ridewrangler
#Bounce through the Merry Vale hoop
#*While on your ride bounce on the specific launch pad in North-Eastern [[Merry Vale]], aim for the middle of the pad.
#Speak with [[Troy Ridewrangler]] located near the [[Seaside]] [[Warpstones|Warpstone]].
#*"Good job! Your ride's understanding of the basics has been transferred to the Training Saddle!<br />Training is hard work. Come back tomorrow and we can continue the training!" -Troy Ridewrangler
